        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: South Park, The Simpsons, South Park season 6, \"Simpsons Already Did It\", \"Professor Chaos\"\n- People: Trey Parker, Matt Stone\n- Concepts: Episode continuity, plot premise\n\nFacts:\n- South Park season 6 of the American animated television series South Park began airing on March 6, 2002.\n- Trey Parker and Matt Stone created the American animated television series South Park.\n- \"Simpsons Already Did It\" is the seventh episode of South Park season 6.\n- \"Simpsons Already Did It\" is the 86th episode of South Park overall.\n- \"Simpsons Already Did It\" continues the events of the previous episode \"Professor Chaos\".\n- In \"Simpsons Already Did It\", Butters devises schemes to take over the world and realizes that each scheme had already been done on The Simpsons.",
